    "detailed_description": "Learn and test your knowledge of 176 countries across the world. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are two separate game modes:<br />\r\nEasy mode is a multi-choice where you get a random selection of countries and can learn the proper spelling as well.<br />\r\nHard mode the user must type the full proper name in of the country for it to count.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features a colorful moving interface with earth showing and marking the countries as you get them blue for right or red for wrong.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood luck making the world blue!",
